flowchart TD
  accTitle: One request through a serving engine
  accDescr: The scheduler sends prompt chunks to prefill and later tokens to decode. Both paths can produce a token for streaming. Unfinished requests return to the scheduler. A stop or cancellation releases request-owned state.
  A["Validate, tokenize and queue"] --> S["Schedule token work"]
  S -->|Prompt positions| P["Prefill a prompt chunk"]
  S -->|Generated position| D["Decode with prior KV"]
  P -->|More prompt left| S
  P -->|End of prompt| T["Select a token ID"]
  D --> T
  T --> O["Stream available text"]
  O -->|Continue| S
  O -->|Stop or length limit| F["Release request state"]
  S -.->|Abort| F
  classDef memory fill:#f7e7c6,stroke:#af8b45,color:#332b16
  class S,F memory
